…NameDateFebruary 28, 2025TitleUPDATE 10 ğŸ†Imagerbxassetid://103123155567436CodeChangesscriptğŸ† RANKEDDescriptionWelcome to Ranked Season 0!?This season will be the first ever look at the new Ranked mode.”Everything is subject to change and we welcome all feedback and criticism as we improve Ranked to make it the most competitive experience on Roblox!HeaderHow to play Ranked“Ranked is the brand new, competitive mode in RIVALS! You can compete against other players in a stricter, fairer environment to see who's the best!•To unlock access to Ranked, simply open up the Ranked page by first pressing the Play button or by interacting with the Ranked Hologram in the lobby!tThere, you will either have immediate access to Ranked or have to complete a few requirements before gaining access.Unlocking your rank†Once Ranked is unlocked, you can start playing your first few Ranked duels. These initial set of duels are known as your "placements".eYour placements are 10 duels long. Once you play 10 Ranked duels, you will unlock your starting rank!YOnce your rank is unlocked, any further Ranked duels will result in gaining / losing ELO!What is ELO?oELO is what determines your rank. The more ELO you have, the higher your rank is. Better players have more ELO!RLosing a Ranked duel lowers your ELO, while winning a Ranked duel raises your ELO!AOnce you've gained enough ELO, you will promote to a better rank!ZLikewise, if you happen to lose enough ELO, you will unfortunately demote to a lower rank.^ELO can only be affected by playing Ranked â€” your ELO is completely safe in all other modes!ËAfter your placements are complete, you will start to receive 1 free ELO Shield every day. This protects you from losing ELO for 1 Ranked duel! ELO Shields cannot be purchased or earned in any other way.What's different in Ranked??Ranked duels have a variety of gameplay changes & restrictions.iMap pools are kept fair & competitive, which means maps such as Backrooms will not show up during voting!}During voting, only 3 maps will be shown at a time. Both teams will then get to ban 1 of these maps, leaving 1 map remaining!~Once map bans are complete, both teams will then start banning weapons. This completely disables a weapon for the entire duel!äMobile & controller handicaps are restricted in Ranked. Third Person Mode is disabled, Aim Assist Strength is capped at 50%, and Auto Shoot Mode is restricted to Dynamic â€” a new feature that keeps problematic weapons in check!^Last but not least, Weapon Switching is restricted to only 2 switches max for the entire duel!Win streaks are safe in Ranked!Ranked rewardsÄThroughout the season, you are able to earn a free Common Skin â€” the Phoenix Rifle! This Assault Rifle skin is obtained simply by winning enough ranked duels â€” more details in the Ranked page!iThere will be end-of-season rewards based on your final ELO & total ranked wins â€” soon to be announced!Leaderboard0There's a brand new leaderboard just for Ranked!nThis leaderboard stands alone in the hallway to the duel pads. Here, you can see the top players in the world!”Players that place high on this leaderboard will be rewarded with extremely rare & exclusive loot at the end of the season â€” soon to be announced!	ğŸ—º MAPS)Brand new lobby created by @GreatGuyBoom!,NEW "Playground" Map â€” Created by @Nosniy!0NEW "Big Onyx" Map â€” Created by @ShadowTrojan!1REVAMPED "Onyx" Map â€” Created by @ShadowTrojan!,REVAMPED "Docks" Map â€” Created by @Nosniy!-REVAMPED "Splash" Map â€” Created by @Nosniy!1REVAMPED "Big Splash" Map â€” Created by @Nosniy!ÚNEW Legacy Maps â€” You can now play all of the legacy versions of existing maps in Private Servers which includes Legacy Backrooms, Legacy Big Splash, Legacy Splash, Legacy Docks, Legacy Onyx, & Legacy Big Crossroads!&Slight visual improvements to Station!fSeveral maps now use the new out-of-bounds feature from Bridge to ensure a fun experience on all maps!VThe map pools for all queues have been redone to ensure a fun experience in all modes!New Maps page in the Career page â€” Shows you all of the maps in the game & who made them, which queues they can be played in, and your performance on each map! NOTE: Your map performances have begun tracking now and are only accurate starting from this update onwards!â­ GAMEPLAY=Players now receive a 0.5s forcefield at the start of rounds!YYou can now see your connection ping & the server region at the top right of your screen!)You can no longer draw rounds on purpose!®Almost every weapon has received balance changes! Handicaps for mobile & controller players have also been addressed! View all of the details below in "ğŸ”« BALANCE CHANGES"!	ğŸ”¥ SHOP9Daily Shop refresh costs have been significantly reduced!PNEW Legendary Keytana Skin â€” Replaced the AKEY-47 in the Legendary Key Bundle!GNEW Legendary Keyvolver Skin â€” Now available in the Ultra Key Bundle!>NEW Simulation Wrap â€” Replaced the Empress wrap in the Shop!>NEW Arena Wrap â€” Replaced the Pixel Blight wrap in the Shop!]New Offline Gifting â€” You can now send gifts to anyone, even if they're not in your server!ğŸ¥³ COSMETICS*Eliminate @â€Œviecti for the viecti charm!6Eliminate @â€ŒSharkTactics for the SharkTactics charm!)Eliminate @D_reamz for the D_reamz charm!,Brand new animations for the Hot Coals skin!âš™ SETTINGS{New Crosshair Setting "Show While Aiming" â€” Makes it so that your crosshair doesn't disappear while aiming with a weapon!TNew Crosshair Setting "Scale" â€” Allows you to easily grow & shrink your crosshair!jNew Crosshair Settings "Circle" â€” A new crosshair component that places a circle around your center dot!New Setting "Aiming Hides Muzzle Flash" â€” Turning this on will completely hide muzzle flash effects while aiming with a weapon!‚New Setting "Auto Shoot Mode" â€” Allows you to use Dynamic mode which means your Auto Shoot's reaction time will dynamically change based on the weapon you're using! This setting is enforced in Ranked and exists here to allow players to practice for Ranked!¶New Setting "Auto Shoot Reaction Time" â€” You can now change your Auto Shoot's reaction time (in milliseconds) to whatever you prefer so long as "Auto Shoot Mode" is set to Enabled!âš” PRIVATE SERVERS5You can now start up a duel alone in Private Servers!3You can now unban players from your Private Server!ˆPrivate Servers now support private Ranked duels! Experience and practice the ranked ruleset with your friends without risking your ELO!†You now have to manually enable the "Unrestricted Map Voting" setting in a Private Server to gain access to all maps in private duels!ğŸ”« BALANCE CHANGESBow:ğŸ“ "These changes aim to make Bow less of a spam weapon"$ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 40 â†’ 30-ğŸ”» Critical damage decreased from 60 â†’ 50[ğŸ’ª Charge damage increased from (50% / 100% / 150% / 200%) â†’ (50% / 100% / 150% / 240%)-ğŸ’ª Move Speed increased from Normal â†’ +5%Crossbow5ğŸ“ "The previous nerfs for Crossbow were too harsh"&ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 37.5 â†’ 458â– Critical hit multiplier decreased from 2x â†’ 1.667xRPGxğŸ“ "The RPG struggled to be viable with a 4-hit-elimination, so it's getting some power shifted to it's splash damage"+ğŸ’ª Splash damage increased from 40 â†’ 50-ğŸ”» Direct damage decreased from 120 â†’ 100Shotgun;ğŸ“ "These changes will help shotgun feel more consistent"ğŸ’ª New consistent spread4ğŸ’ª Bullets can now pierce through multiple enemies0ğŸ”» Shoot cooldown increased from 0.7s â†’ 0.8sEnergy Rifle`ğŸ“ "This rework makes the Energy Rifle's bounce shots more practical to use and less gimmicky"5ğŸ”» Bounce body shots no longer deal critical damage$ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 20 â†’ 15-ğŸ”» Critical damage decreased from 60 â†’ 252ğŸ’ª Direct headshots can now deal critical damage9ğŸ’ª Bounce Redirection Angle increased from 0Â° â†’ 10Â°Flamethrower7ğŸ“ "Burn weapons have been collectively standardized"EğŸ”» Airblast can now only push smoke clouds instead of clearing thembğŸ”» Burn damage has been reworked, view note at the bottom of the balance changes for more detail ğŸ”» Total DPS decreased by ~25%Grenade Launcher”ğŸ“ "Bringing down the direct damage prevents certain weapon combos from dominating. We also want the projectile hitbox to feel similar to the RPG"=ğŸ’ª Projectile hitbox size increased from 0.5studs â†’ 1stud,ğŸ”» Direct damage decreased from 100 â†’ 80GunbladePğŸ“ "We're improving the Gunblade's performance to compete with meta primaries".ğŸ’ª Move Speed increased from -10% â†’ Normal$ğŸ’ª Damage dropoff has been removed%ğŸ”» Max Ammo decreased from 16 â†’ 8MinigunlğŸ“ "Minigun has been a quiet menace. We'll be keeping an eye on it's performance after these slight nerfs":ğŸ”» Critical hit multiplier decreased from 1.5x â†’ 1.25xHğŸ”» Damage dropoff minimum distance decreased from 100studs â†’ 50studsPaintball GunxğŸ“ "This rework aims to make the Paintball Gun feel more like real paintball guns in the sense of having lots of ammo"&ğŸ’ª Max Ammo increased from 16 â†’ 24.ğŸ”» Max Ammo Reserve decreased from 48 â†’ 24&ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 20 â†’ 18.5Daggers7ğŸ“ "Daggers have felt too much like a primary weapon"+ğŸ”» Move Speed decreased from +15% â†’ +5%Energy PistolseğŸ“ "While the Energy Pistols trade strength for unlimited ammo and speed, it proved to be too weak"'ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 2.25 â†’ 2.4	Flare Gun7ğŸ”» Flares are now colored properly to indicate danger ğŸ”» Total DPS decreased by ~50%HandguneğŸ“ "This change conserves the Handgun's power while requiring less spam-clicking to make use of it"2ğŸ’ª Equip cooldown decreased from 0.66s â†’ 0.45s$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 11 â†’ 131ğŸ”» Shoot Cooldown increased from 0.1s â†’ 0.13sShortyağŸ“ "The Shorty is going to keep its lethal damage in exchange for a significant ammo reduction"(ğŸ”» Spread increased from 10Â° â†’ 15Â°-ğŸ”» Max Ammo Reserve decreased from 36 â†’ 2	SlingshotZğŸ“ "Slingshot has been extremely oppressive and way too powerful for a secondary weapon""ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 7 â†’ 6'ğŸ”» Can no longer deal critical damage+ğŸ”» Move Speed decreased from +10% â†’ +5%SpraywğŸ“ "The Spray has struggled to find an identity â€” we now want it to be the cheap counter to Katanas & Riot Shields"/ğŸ’ª Equip cooldown decreased from 1s â†’ 0.45sdğŸ’ª Now uses illegally-modified-armor-piercing-rounds that can penetrate through shields & deflects3ğŸ— Price has been reduced from 25 keys â†’ 5 keysUziCğŸ“ "This quality of life change makes the Uzi feel better to use"+ğŸ’ª Aim Speed increased from 100% â†’ 150%
Battle Axe@ğŸ“ "The high spin damage created too many anti-fun strategies")ğŸ”» Spin Damage decreased from 50 â†’ 40$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 50 â†’ 55Trowel…ğŸ“ "We're improving the Trowel's cover-on-demand identity in addition to reducing the effectiveness of barricading on certain maps"EğŸ’ª Wall hitboxes now build instantly (visuals have stayed the same)-ğŸ”» Wall Max Bricks decreased from 75 â†’ 25/ğŸ”» Hardened Bricks can no longer be re-thrown	Flashbang6ğŸ“ "We're removing this unintended & toxic mechanic"ğŸ”» Can no longer be cooked
Freeze RayIğŸ“ "All actions should be halted while frozen for consistency purposes"6ğŸ’ª Enemies can no longer switch weapons while frozenMolotov*ğŸ’ª Splash damage increased from 0 â†’ 10*ğŸ’ª Hitboxes are now extremely consistent+ğŸ”» Fire can no longer spawn through walls ğŸ”» Total DPS decreased by ~33%Satchel„ğŸ“ "Satchel was ridiculously powerful on launch. We're swapping its power for mobility, while also rewarding strategic placements"$ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 50 â†’ 20DğŸ”» Can no longer stick onto teammates that don't have Riot Shields8ğŸ’ª Satchels attached to walls now deal critical damage+ğŸ’ª Knockback increased from 125% â†’ 150%Smoke GrenadeNğŸ“ "It doesn't make sense for smoke clouds to last long in fast-paced duels"4ğŸ”» Smoke cloud lifetime decreased from 30s â†’ 10sOther6ğŸ”» 3rd Person Camera removed from controller playersEğŸ’ª Mobile players can now sprint & slide while aiming with a weapongğŸ’ª Auto Shoot no longer activates if the enemy is out-of-reach for weapons like Flamethrower & meleesSğŸ”» Auto Shoot can no longer shoot enemies that are behind you while in 3rd person\ğŸ”» Aim Assist has been reworked to have a more springy-feel which may be harder to controlÏğŸ”» Burn damage no longer deals damage the moment it's applied to a player. This used to cause scenarios where fire weapons would deal ~25-50% more damage than intended as the burn would kick in instantly. This behavior also allowed multiple fire weapons to deal unintentionally high amounts of damage when paired together. This change not only makes fire weapons more fair to play against, but also makes it easier for the developers to balance these mechanics.
ğŸ›  OTHERnYou can now bind the same keybind to multiple different actions (example: MB1 can be used to both Aim & Shoot),Teammates are now transparent at round start<Slight visual improvements to the Elimination Feed interface/Slight visual improvements to the Settings page1Slight visual improvements to the Party interface9Slight visual improvements to the Final Results interface$New player card UI after a duel endssYou can now see how likely a map is to be chosen for the duel based off of all of the votes during the voting phaseaVisual improvements to the way the Uranium Launcher, Aqua Burst, & Hyper Sniper skins are wrappedOVisual improvements to the way that the Pixel Blight wrap is applied onto skinssThe bottom button for the Career page has been removed and can now be accessed by first going into the Weapons pageqThe bottom button for the Rewards page has been removed and can now be accessed by first going into the Shop pagekThe Festive Event has concluded and all associated limited time content & cosmetics are no longer available_Unlock Tokens have been converted into Standard Weapon Crates & are now completely discontinuedğŸ› BUG FIXES_Fixed a bug where using a Medkit would give you a cooldown even if it didn't end up healing youUFixed a bug where Auto Shoot wouldn't properly throw Grenades & other similar weaponsIFixed a bug that allowed players to fling Molotovs far away super quicklyMFixed a rare bug with Scythe that allowed players to hop at ridiculous speedsIFixed a dash-jump bug with Scythe/Battle Axe/Gunblade & Subspace TripmineQFixed a rare bug where flares would be invisible but still deal damage to playersBFixed a bug where smoke clouds sometimes wouldnt extinguish flaresbFixed a bug where Smoke Grenades and Molotovs would activate when going through invisible barriersWFixed a bug with Chainsaw / Flamethrower where being frozen wouldn't cancel your inputs(Fixed an audio bug with Satchel detonate_Fixed a bug where the Milk & Cookies healing animation healed you slightly sooner than intendedRFixed various UI bugs where certain UI elements would clash with other UI elementsaFixed a bug where the mobile controls editor showed up for non-mobile players when hiding the HUD]Fixed a bug where locked cosmetics wouldn't appear to be locked when viewing lootbox contentsYFixed a bug where owned weapons wouldn't appear to be owned when viewing lootbox contentsIFixed a bug where you couldn't import mobile controls from another playerxFixed a bug that caused the on-screen-keyboard to get stuck for mobile players while chatting during the teleport screengFixed a rare bug where players using a controller showed up as if they were playing on keyboard & mouseFFixed a bug that caused DPS dummies to display slightly inaccurate DPS>Fixed a rare bug where changing the jump keybind wouldn't workfFixed a rare bug where you would randomly spectate other players during a duel even while you're aliveVFixed a bug where spectating an empty duel would spectate the lobby instead of the mapoFixed a bug where match point / sudden death in Graveyard / Big Graveyard wouldn't change the lighting properlyhFixed a bug in Construction where the spinning shipping container could be messed up by specific weaponsVFixed a bug where disabling textures didn't affect maps like Crossroads/Big CrossroadsBFixed a bug where disabling textures mid-game wouldn't do anything`Fixed a bug that caused some players to be put into games even after stepping off of a queue padQFixed a bug where slide jumping into a thin wall allowed you to noclip through itaFixed a bug where players would spawn underneath the floor and/or inside of walls in certain mapsPPotentially fixed a bug that caused players to float away at the start of rounds9Fixed a visual bug with how crosshair outlines overlapped[Fixed bugs in all maps where certain spots wouldn't cause explosive projectiles to detonate$Fixed invisible barriers in all maps9Fixed a bug in Graveyard where windows couldn't be brokenğŸ“œ A NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPERS†We hope you all enjoy Ranked! It's been a long time coming and we've worked very hard to get this out as soon as possible to everyone.lThis is our first time working on something like this and we're excited to see how the ranked scene unfolds!šWe will be taking any and all feedback very seriously as we understand how important it is to listen to the community when it comes to competitive scenes.ĞThere may or may not be a few issues right now with Ranked that we may have overlooked or not anticipated for, but rest assured that we're committed to fixing & improving everything we can in a timely manner.PThank you all for the continued support and be sure to finally check out Ranked!␀…\␀␀
